  "findings": [
    "Instructions alone produced valid repeated tool calls but never closed the loop with a final answer.",
    "One complete Tool Call to Tool Result to Answer example raised formal task success from 0/12 to 10/12.",
    "All 24 formal runs retained one State ID and released it successfully.",
    "The same fix-and-test prompt passed 4/4 sequentially and 4/4 in a homogeneous C4 probe but failed 2/2 in the mixed formal C4 matrix, indicating batch-composition-sensitive greedy trajectories."
  ],
